WEBVTT

00:01:59.824 --> 00:02:02.535
What wall length will save your kingdom?

00:02:02.869 --> 00:02:05.580
Pause here to figure it out yourself.
Answer in 3

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:08.124
Answer in 2

00:02:08.124 --> 00:02:10.459
Answer in 1

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:14.213
It's possible to solve this problem
by trial and error.

00:02:14.213 --> 00:02:17.800
But there’s also a remarkably quick
and elegant solution

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:21.345
inspired by an idea that’s thousands 
of years old:

00:02:21.345 --> 00:02:23.514
the sieve of Eratosthenes.

00:02:23.806 --> 00:02:30.062
Eratosthenes of Cyrene was a 3rd century 
BCE mathematician from ancient Greece